    "body": "Walaalayaal, dhankayaga Baydhabo roobkii wuu yaraaday, masagadii aan beeranayna badankeedu intaanay midho dhalin bay engegtay. Waxaan maqlay in ay jiraan noocyo masago ah oo abaaraha u adkaysta oo xilli gaaban ku bislaada. Yaa wax iga caawin kara: noocyadee ayaa ugu habboon dhulka Koonfur Galbeed, xaggeese laga helaa abuur la hubo? Suuqa Baydhabo waxaa lagu iibiyaa abuur aan la garanayn halka uu ka yimid, mana rabo inaan xilli kale khasaaro. Mahadsanidin walaalayaal.",
    "tags": [
      "agri-food",
      "community"
    ],
    "daysAgo": 14,
    "askStatus": "answered",
    "comments": [
      {
        "authorHandle": "amina_biyo",
        "body": "Xasan walaal, su'aashan aad bay muhiim u tahay. Noocyada aan beeralayda kula talinno: (1) Gadam — xilli gaaban, 75 ilaa 85 maalmood buu ku bislaadaa, abaartana aad buu ugu adkaystaa; (2) Seredo — wax yar buu ka dheer yahay laakiin midho badan buu dhalaa haddii roob xoogaa la helo. Labadaba Baay iyo Bakool waa lagu tijaabiyay. Abuur shahaadaysan (certified) waxaad ka helaysaa xafiiska wasaaradda beeraha ee Baydhabo iyo iskaashatooyinka abuurka ee ay FAO taageerto — weydii warqadda shahaadada, hana qaadan kiish aan calaamad lahayn. Abuurka suuqa furan badankiisu waa isku-dhafan, kama bixi karo. Haddii aad rabto waxaan kugu xidhi karaa wakiilka abuurka ee Baydhabo — DM ii soo dir, lambarkiisa ayaan ku siin.",
        "daysAgo": 13,
        "credited": true,
        "reactions": [
          {
            "handle": "xasan_beero",
            "type": "strong"
          },
          {
            "handle": "hamdi_agritech",
            "type": "fire"
          },
          {
            "handle": "ubax_beerta",
            "type": "mashallah"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "authorHandle": "hamdi_agritech",
        "body": "Adding a research note from my agronomy course: in FAO/ICRISAT trials in the Bay region, Gadam matured 2-3 weeks earlier than local landraces and kept a usable yield even in below-average rain years. Two things that matter as much as the variety: plant early with the first rains, and keep spacing wide in a dry year — crowded masago loses more to drought than to birds. Aabbahay isla arrintan ayuu ku qancay markii uu isha ku arkay. Marka Xasan adeer, tijaabi jeeb yar marka hore (test on a small plot first).",
        "daysAgo": 13
      },
      {
        "authorHandle": "ubax_beerta",
        "body": "Xasan adeer, waad ku mahadsan tahay su'aasha — dad badan ayay anfacaysaa. Anigu yaanyo ayaan beeraa laakiin waxaan kugu dhiirrigelinayaa talada Aamina: abuur la hubo waa nus guul. Haddii aad markaan tijaabinayso, jeeb yar ku bilow oo nala soco natiijada — halkan ku soo qor waxa kuu shaqeeyay si beeralayda kale ay wax uga bartaan. Guul iyo roob wanaagsan!",
        "daysAgo": 12
      },
      {
        "authorHandle": "xasan_beero",
        "body": "Mahadsanidin dhammaan. Aamina, fariin gaar ah ayaan kuu soo dirayaa si aan lambarka wakiilka u helo. Hamdi, talada jeebka yar waan qaatay — meel yar ayaan ku tijaabin doonaa Gadam marka hore. Ilaahay roob ha inoo keeno.",
        "daysAgo": 12
      }
    ],
