    "title": "Ramadan hours + camel milk Fridays at Luul's Halal Market",
    "body": "Community notice from Lake Street!\nRamadan hours at Luul's Halal Market: open 10am to 1am all month, so you can shop after taraweeh. Fresh sambuus wrappers daily, three kinds of dates this year (including Sukari — finally), and xawaash ground in-store like always.\nBy popular demand: camel milk Fridays are back! Fresh delivery from our supplier every Friday morning, limited stock, first come first served. Call the store and we will set some aside for you.\nNew this year: pre-packed iftar boxes for busy families — bariis, hilib, dates, and a sambuus pack. Text your order by Wednesday for Friday pickup.\nRamadan kariim, everyone — see you on Lake Street. My mother still checks the basmati herself, so you know it's the good one.",
