        "body": "Macalin Cali this hit HARD. We literally have a rule in our study circle called 'no shame questions' — you can ask anything, however basic, and nobody blinks. Half our members came back to maths at university because someone finally let them ask the grade-5 question they'd been carrying for ten years. Printing this post for our next session, with your permission 🙏",
